<title>USA: Essex County, N.J., $23 mln notes won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Essex County, N.J., $23 mln notes won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc said Wednesday it won $23.11 million Essex County, N.J., bond anticipation notes with a net interest cost of 4.057 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
